// Pipeline ROI Naming Map — single source of truth for all ROI definitions.
//
// DEVELOPER REFERENCE — PyTheraTwin ROI ↔ PBPK VOI connections:
// ┌─────────────────────────┬──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────┐
// │ PyTheraTwin ROI (pipeline name) │ PBPK VOI (PyCNO)     │ TotalSegmentator source labels           │
// ├─────────────────────────┼──────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────┤
// │ kidney                  │ Kidney               │ kidney_left + kidney_right               │
// │ liver                   │ Liver                │ liver                                    │
// │ prostate                │ Prostate             │ prostate                                 │
// │ spleen                  │ Spleen               │ spleen                                   │
// │ heart                   │ Heart                │ heart                                    │
// │ salivary_glands         │ SG                   │ parotid+submandibular L+R (head task)    │
// │ lungs                   │ Lungs                │ 5 lung lobes (total task)                │
// │ brain                   │ Brain                │ brain                                    │
// │ gi_tract                │ GI                   │ stomach + small_bowel + duodenum + colon │
// │ bone                    │ Bone                 │ spine + skull + ribs + major limb bones  │
// │ muscle                  │ Muscle               │ gluteus + autochthon + iliopsoas groups  │
// ├─────────────────────────┼──────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────┤
// │ adrenal_glands          │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ adrenal_gland_right + adrenal_gland_left │
// │ thyroid_gland           │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ thyroid_gland                            │
// │ gallbladder             │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ gallbladder                              │
// │ pancreas                │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ pancreas                                 │
// │ esophagus               │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ esophagus                                │
// │ trachea                 │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ trachea                                  │
// │ urinary_bladder         │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ urinary_bladder                          │
// │ kidney_cyst             │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ kidney_cyst_left + kidney_cyst_right     │
// │ spinal_cord             │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ spinal_cord                              │
// │ aorta                   │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ aorta                                    │
// │ pulmonary_vein          │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ pulmonary_vein                           │
// │ brachiocephalic_vessels │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ brachiocephalic trunk+subclavian+vein L+R│
// │ carotid_arteries        │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ common_carotid L+R                       │
// │ portal_vein             │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ portal_vein_and_splenic_vein             │
// │ iliac_arteries          │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ iliac_artery L+R                         │
// │ iliac_veins             │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ iliac_vena L+R                           │
// │ atrial_appendage        │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ atrial_appendage_left                    │
// │ superior_vena_cava      │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ superior_vena_cava                       │
// │ inferior_vena_cava      │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ inferior_vena_cava                       │
// │ eyes                    │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ eye_left + eye_right (head task)         │
// │ eye_lenses              │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ eye_lens_left + eye_lens_right           │
// │ optic_nerves            │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ optic_nerve_left + optic_nerve_right     │
// │ nasopharynx             │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ nasopharynx                              │
// │ oropharynx              │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ oropharynx                               │
// │ hypopharynx             │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ hypopharynx                              │
// │ nasal_cavity            │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ nasal_cavity_right + nasal_cavity_left   │
// │ auditory_canal          │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ auditory_canal_right + auditory_canal_left│
// │ soft_palate             │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ soft_palate                              │
// │ hard_palate             │ (no dedicated VOI)   │ hard_palate                              │
// └─────────────────────────┴──────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────┘
//
// PBPK_observables: PyCNO PSMA model observables requested by the PBPK stage.
// pbpk_voi: PyCNO PSMA model observable name. null = no dedicated VOI (falls back to Rest TAC).
//   User ROIs with a non-null, non-Rest pbpk_voi are "simulation-eligible".
//   Internal labels:
//     remaining_body -> Rest
//     synthetic_lesion -> Tumor1
// ui_category: grouping used in the web UI panel for each TotalSegmentator task.

